INSERT INTO `accession` VALUES (1,2,1,2,0,'[\"NMAH\",\"AC\",\"0594\",\"1\"]','Krispy Kreme corporate records','Krispy Kreme corporate records',0,'Contains correspondence, administrative records, operational records, company newsletters, news clippings, photographs, photograph albums, and audiovisual materials created and compiled by the Krispy Kreme corporation between approximately 1930 and 2005.','Generally good, the collection contains photographs that required rehousing and audiovisual material that requires reformatting\r\n',NULL,NULL,'This collection was donated to the National Museum of American History, Archives Center on July 17, 1997, by the Krispy Kreme Corporation',NULL,251,244,'1997-07-17',0,NULL,1,'Collection will be open for research once processed.',1,'Collection items are available for reproduction, but the Archives Center makes no guarantee concerning copyright restrictions. Other intellectual property rights may apply. Archives Center cost-recovery and use fees may apply when requesting reproductions','admin','admin','2022-04-03 18:23:48','2022-04-03 18:51:51','2022-04-03 18:32:10',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),(4,0,1,2,0,'[\"2021\",\"001\",null,null]','Richard Saholt collection','Richard Saholt collection',0,'This collection contains materials pertaining to the life and career of Richard Saholt, who was a Minneapolis-based collage artist. The collection consists of correspondence, medical and military files, artwork reproductions, audiovisual materials, slides, photographs, a scrapbook, and press materials. ','The collection consists of materials, such as VHS tapes, 35mm slides, and a scrapbook that will need proper housing. Other materials, such as correspondence, will need basic preservation like the removal of staples and paperclips.',NULL,NULL,'Donated by Michael Bonesteel',NULL,248,245,'2021-02-03',0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,'admin','admin','2022-04-17 23:26:33','2022-04-17 23:26:33','2022-04-17 23:26:33',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),(5,0,1,2,0,'[\"2020\",\"001\",null,null]','\"Box of vintage gay zines\" and \"Queer elders project\"','\"Box of vintage gay zines\" and \"Queer elders project\"',0,'This collection contains LGBT magazines, chapbooks, and other related material. It also contains materials related to the gallery exhibit of the magazines and such, as well as an Instagram account.','The collection has basic preservation concerns. ',NULL,NULL,'Gift of Anna Pachner','This collection began as a box of LGBT magazines, chapbooks, and other material that was left on the side of the road for trash collection in Burlington, Vermont in November of 2018.',248,245,'2020-02-17',0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,'admin','admin','2022-04-17 23:30:49','2022-04-17 23:30:49','2022-04-17 23:30:49',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),(7,0,1,4,0,'[\"2018\",\"001\",null,null]','Black Student Alliance records','Black Student Alliance records',0,'These materials contain records of the Black Student Alliance as well as records of the Black History Month Planning Committee, a group that formed every year to assist with programming events for Black History Month celebrations at the University of Tennessee at Chattanooga. Most materials in this series date from 1970 to the early 1990s.','Materials have basic preservation concerns.',NULL,NULL,'Unknown',NULL,251,244,'2018-08-08',0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,'admin','admin','2022-04-25 03:45:48','2022-04-25 03:45:48','2022-04-25 03:45:48',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),(8,0,1,4,0,'[\"2015\",\"439\",null,null]','Tomie Arai and Legan Wong Papers','Tomie Arai and Legan Wong Papers',0,'Collection of Tomie Arai and Legan Wong document the spouses\' work in the arts, Asian American Studies, and the Asian American Movement in New York. Some of the publications and posters in the collection are bilingual in English and either Japanese, Korean, or Chinese. This collection also contains exhibition catalogues and ephemera. Arai\'s work as an artist is documented in this collection through exhibition promotional material, original drawings, printwork created for publications and community organizations, correspondence and project files. This collection also includes materials created and collected by Legan Wong documenting his creation of college courses on the Asian American experience in the 1970s as well as a small amount of material related to his music production work with East West World Records in the 1980s. This collection also contains material related to Wong\'s participation in the Asian Tactical Theater, Soh Daiko, and an Asian American Softball League team in New York. Materials from Arai\'s early life and family include Arai\'s elementary and high school memorabilia from the 1960s and items accumulated by Arai\'s parents specifically related to their experience as people of Japanese descent in the United States during and after World War II. These materials include research, publications produced and distributed at individual facilities, and original artwork by Arai\'s uncle, Unosuke Sasaki, created during his period of incarceration at the Topaz Relocation Center, a concentration camp in Utah, in the early 1940s.','Audiovisual materials will need to be digitized to be accessed. The collection contains vinyl and lacquer records and 1 VHS tape. Oversize materials will need appropriate housing. Other materials need basic preservation.',NULL,NULL,'Donated by Tomie Arai, 2015',NULL,250,245,'2015-11-17',0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,'admin','admin','2022-04-25 03:49:13','2022-04-25 03:49:13','2022-04-25 03:49:13',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),(9,0,1,2,0,'[\"2017\",\"002\",null,null]','Native Americans in Film','Native Americans in Film',0,'This collection contains movie scripts, press and promotional booklets, lobby cards, posters, and photographs featuring Native American themes, characters, and actors.','The collection contains oversize materials, such as posters, that will need to be housed properly. It has basic preservation concerns, such as rusted staples and paperclips.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Purchase, George Robert Minkoff, Inc. Rare Books, 2017. Acquired by the Newberry with the Society of Collectors and Duplicates funds',2631,2630,'2017-03-14',0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,'admin','admin','2022-05-23 17:35:51','2022-05-23 17:35:52','2022-05-23 17:35:51',NULL,1,NULL,NULL);
